{"out": "S0E8_water", "end": "قدّيش كان صعب العطش؟ خبّروني", "endsub": "How hard was the thirst? Tell me", "lines": [{"who": "Souad", "ar": "وداد… عمر عطشان.", "en": "Wadad… Omar is thirsty.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.66, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_l01.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "عطشان؟ معو فنجان زغير. هيدا كل شي.", "en": "Thirsty? He gets a tiny cup. That's it.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_cup.png", "z": [1.1, 1.25, 0.45, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_l02.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "وأنا؟ قاعدة فاضية سنين! ولا نقطة!", "en": "And me? Sitting empty for years! Not a drop!", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_empty.png", "z": [1.1, 1.25, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_l03.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "لمّا نحنا ما منطلّع مي، كل شربة بتبقى بالجسم… بالإجرين، بالرية.", "en": "When we don't make urine, every sip stays in the body… in the legs, in the lungs.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.0, 1.1, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_l04.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "لهيك «اشرب مي كتير» نصيحة غلط عالغسيل. وبعد الزراعة؟ صار لازم يشرب منيح، متل ما بيقلّو فريقو.", "en": "That's why \"drink lots of water\" is wrong advice on dialysis. After the transplant? He has to drink well, as his team tells him.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/newkidney.png", "z": [1.0, 1.12, 0.5, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_l05.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "يعني رجعت إشتغل؟!", "en": "So I'm back to work?!", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_happy.png", "z": [1.1, 1.25, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e8_l06.mp3"}]}